{
  "id": "divide-with-rest",
  "title": {
    "tr": "Bölüm ve Kalan",
    "en": "Quotient and Remainder"
  },
  "difficulty": 2,
  "language": "rust",
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "starter": "starter.{lang}.rs",
  "solution": "solution.rs",
  "timeout_sec": 45,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "Dönüş satırı: `(a / b, a % b)`.",
      "en": "The return line: `(a / b, a % b)`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```rust\nfn divide(a: i32, b: i32) -> (i32, i32) {\n    (a / b, a % b)\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    let (quotient, rest) = divide(17, 5);\n    println!(\"17 / 5 = {quotient} rest {rest}\");\n}\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```rust\nfn divide(a: i32, b: i32) -> (i32, i32) {\n    (a / b, a % b)\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    let (quotient, rest) = divide(17, 5);\n    println!(\"17 / 5 = {quotient} rest {rest}\");\n}\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "stdout",
      "match": "trimmed_lines",
      "expected": "17 / 5 = 3 rest 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "rust_test",
      "tests": [
        {
          "code": "assert_eq!(divide(17, 5), (3, 2));",
          "label": {
            "tr": "divide(17, 5)",
            "en": "divide(17, 5)"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "assert_eq!(divide(10, 2), (5, 0));",
          "label": {
            "tr": "divide(10, 2)",
            "en": "divide(10, 2)"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "assert_eq!(divide(3, 7), (0, 3));",
          "label": {
            "tr": "divide(3, 7)",
            "en": "divide(3, 7)"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
